      <text>9.5 Manipulating indices</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Let \(a={@ax@}\), \(b={@by@}\).</p>

<p>Write the following expressions in terms of \(a\) and \(b\) only: </p>
<p>a) {@quest_1@} \(=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>

<p>b) {@quest_2@}  \(=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>

<p>c) {@quest_3@}  \(=\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>

<p>d) {@quest_4@}  \(=\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</p>

<p>e) {@quest_5@}  \(=\) [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
